# Packages layout (GUARD 5)

## 1. Single-feature — flat `src/`

Doors + `{code}-*` only. Example: `packages/ai`, `packages/features/lynx`.

## 2. Multi-feature — `src/features/<slice>/` flat

Example: `packages/features/system-admin`.

## 3. Tiered-feature — `src/<feature>/<sub-feature>/` flat (HR Suite)

```text
src/<feature-domain>/<sub-feature-capability>/*   ← layer 3 flat, no buckets
```

Example: `packages/features/hr-suite`  
`hr-suite-integration/` flattens at layer 1 (no sub-feature folder).

